  "subtitle": "beef and onion rice bowl",
  "excerpt": "Gyudon is thinly sliced beef and sweet onion simmered in a dashi and soy broth, then spooned over steamed rice. It is one of Japan's most popular fast-food dishes and easy to make at home. Serves 4.",
