        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gyudon is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "donburi",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "donburi"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " that uses thin-sliced beef and onion simmered in a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dashi",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dashi"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " broth sweetened with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "mirin ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "mirin"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The beef cooks in minutes once the broth is going. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ask the butcher to slice the beef very thin, or freeze the beef for 30 minutes and slice it yourself with a sharp knife."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
